{"4246030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Warriors Of Tengri", "steam_appid": 4246030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>⚔ WARRIORS OF TENGRI ⚔</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>A world forged by ancient myths, shattered by demons, and bound by destiny.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Destruction reigns across the land. Some souls have been dragged into darkness, while others were reforged in the relentless fires of fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The demons that rise are ancient—far older and far more powerful than mortals ever imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If they are not stopped, existence itself will fall. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>📜 THE CALL OF DEDE KORKUT</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In the midst of this darkness, a voice echoes through the ages. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dede Korkut—the keeper of legends—calls upon the chosen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stand beside Tengri’s warriors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grow stronger through battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Carve your destiny into myth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>⚔ COMBAT FORGED BY MYTH</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Fast and fluid 2D side-scrolling combat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Hand-drawn animations and dark mythological art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Skill upgrades, artifacts, and powerful builds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Multi-phase boss battles with unique mechanics </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🗺 A WORLD SHAPED BY LEGENDS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Travel across cursed lands, ancient ruins, frozen plains and sacred realms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Navigate a dynamic world map, uncover dungeons, and face evolving threats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🧑‍🤝‍🧑 FIGHT ALONE OR TOGETHER</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Solo adventure or co-op PvE </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Real-time PvP arenas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• AI-driven encounters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🔥 BECOME THE FINAL HOPE OF HUMANITY 🔥</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stand with Tengri’s champions.<br>Fight the rising darkness.<br>Write a legend that will echo across the ages.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>⚔ WARRIORS OF TENGRI ⚔</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>A world forged by ancient myths, shattered by demons, and bound by destiny.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Destruction reigns across the land. Some souls have been dragged into darkness, while others were reforged in the relentless fires of fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The demons that rise are ancient—far older and far more powerful than mortals ever imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If they are not stopped, existence itself will fall. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>📜 THE CALL OF DEDE KORKUT</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In the midst of this darkness, a voice echoes through the ages. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dede Korkut—the keeper of legends—calls upon the chosen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stand beside Tengri’s warriors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grow stronger through battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Carve your destiny into myth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>⚔ COMBAT FORGED BY MYTH</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Fast and fluid 2D side-scrolling combat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Hand-drawn animations and dark mythological art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Skill upgrades, artifacts, and powerful builds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Multi-phase boss battles with unique mechanics </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🗺 A WORLD SHAPED BY LEGENDS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Travel across cursed lands, ancient ruins, frozen plains and sacred realms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Navigate a dynamic world map, uncover dungeons, and face evolving threats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🧑‍🤝‍🧑 FIGHT ALONE OR TOGETHER</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Solo adventure or co-op PvE </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Real-time PvP arenas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• AI-driven encounters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🔥 BECOME THE FINAL HOPE OF HUMANITY 🔥</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stand with Tengri’s champions.<br>Fight the rising darkness.<br>Write a legend that will echo across the ages.</p>", "short_description": "Destruction reigns. Some souls are dragged into darkness, others reforged in the fires of fate. Ancient demons, far more powerful than imagined, threaten existence itself. Answer Dede Korkut’s call, stand with Tengri’s warriors, grow stronger, fight relentlessly—and become humanity’s final hope.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246030/5d6ab3c2d0beba07441b07a345a733e1e111deb8/header.jpg?t=1786702848", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246030/6b7169cea3000d881c284e28bfbd6fc1c5b83cc4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786702848", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246030/6b7169cea3000d881c284e28bfbd6fc1c5b83cc4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786702848", "website":